                "text": "Health insurance premiums are skyrocketing thanks to the cuts under the President\u2019s \"Big, Beautiful Bill.\"\n\nAffordability is such a critical issue across many fronts -- food, household goods, and others. Let's not make health care more expensive.\n\nhttps://t.co/ylXl9CZO5Q https://t.co/d8Qc7J4CQQ",
