                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter Media Studio",
                "text": "We can't afford to go back to the situation we had before the ACA, when 1 of every 7 Americans didn't have health insurance. We can't afford the wave of uncompensated care costs that will hit hospitals and eventually, all of us. \n\nLet's quickly act to extend the ACA tax credits. https://t.co/FXIgC25LVy",
